{
  "caveats": [
    "Volumes do not identify routes, passenger origins, travel distances, service frequency or unique travellers. The source labels a bus category “Ominibus Services” without defining its overlap with SLTB; the two bus series must not be added as if they were a verified total. Passenger counts and freight tonnage have different units, and air traffic should not be interpreted as resident mobility.",
    "The source uses .. for unavailable figures and a dash for nil or negligible. Both retain their printed token and a distinct status; neither is converted to an exact zero."
