  "notes": [
    "National annual figures for 2022–2025 compiled by DCS from the Sri Lanka Transport Board, National Transport Commission, Department of Railways and Civil Aviation Authority. Passenger series cover railways, omnibus services, SLTB, the national airline and foreign airlines. Freight series cover railways and the two airline categories. Passenger figures are in thousands of persons; freight is in thousands of metric tonnes. The 2024 SLTB passenger figure is revised."
